--- !u!114 &64079195
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 64079194}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 72bc556a096b756458fe11be305d5930, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  organs:
  - organName: Body
    description: 'The human body is a complex structure composed of systems that
      work together to maintain life, protect organs, and enable movement, growth,
      and response to stimuli.


'
    popupPosition: {fileID: 1688053611}
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c4abea397905dfc4d81324c082880a45, type: 3}
  - organName: Brain
    description: The brain is the control center of the body, responsible for thought,
      memory, emotion, coordination, and regulating all bodily functions.
    popupPosition: {fileID: 1998319456}
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: add77572e9b10734a9b55800a0d39e1e, type: 3}
  - organName: Brain_Inner1
    description: The inner brain includes structures like the thalamus, hypothalamus,
      and brainstem that manage unconscious processes like breathing, heart rate,
      and sleep.
    popupPosition: {fileID: 19578788}
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f5e9f7e61e8e50c4b8c380d4d28e83fa, type: 3}
  - organName: Cardiovascular
    description: The cardiovascular system consists of the heart and blood vessels
      and is responsible for transporting oxygen, nutrients, and waste products throughout
      the body.
    popupPosition: {fileID: 2057039908}
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cc369a798e77b524a8e2034f337ae6da, type: 3}
  - organName: Digestive_Sys
    description: The digestive system breaks down food into nutrients, absorbs them
      into the bloodstream, and eliminates waste through organs like the stomach
      and intestines.
    popupPosition: {fileID: 608806600}
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f67133c9ee5bf2e40bf15b094f11a8af, type: 3}
  - organName: Eyes
    description: The eyes are sensory organs that detect light and send visual signals
      to the brain, enabling sight and perception of the environment.
    popupPosition: {fileID: 1394837235}
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b862c7b4fb6e36143bafdba6e16ddeac, type: 3}
  - organName: Ligament1
    description: Ligaments are tough, elastic bands of connective tissue that connect
      bones to other bones, providing stability and support to joints.
    popupPosition: {fileID: 1576291985}
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 696c22a6a2cf4354691158e8df5ac9e1, type: 3}
  - organName: Nervous_System
    description: The nervous system includes the brain, spinal cord, and nerves.
      It transmits signals between body parts and controls voluntary and involuntary
      actions.
    popupPosition: {fileID: 887651770}
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: afc42ecad0414c84c947dcebd92a9b2d, type: 3}
  - organName: Respiratory_Sys
    description: The respiratory system enables breathing by taking in oxygen and
      removing carbon dioxide through organs like the lungs and trachea.
    popupPosition: {fileID: 1493271511}
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 161c13c5a23c4e643bc092b33485d6a4, type: 3}
  - organName: Salivary_Glands
    description: Salivary glands produce saliva to moisten food, aid in digestion,
      and help protect the mouth from infection.
    popupPosition: {fileID: 814647026}
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4153814200637064fa4f5b9664194577, type: 3}
  - organName: Skeleton
    description: "The skeletal system provides the body\u2019s framework, protects
      internal organs, and allows movement in coordination with muscles."
    popupPosition: {fileID: 461311536}
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 61ac95ed0d1be2349b5243ea9dc65863, type: 3}
  - organName: Urinary_Sys
    description: The urinary system removes waste products and excess fluids from
      the body through the kidneys, ureters, bladder, and urethra.
    popupPosition: {fileID: 1167086205}
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a0ecac5c5c11c584faf15db91def3357, type: 3}
  popupPanel: {fileID: 285127116}
  titleText: {fileID: 1525735915}
  descriptionText: {fileID: 1993049146}
  audioSource: {fileID: 64079197}
